{
 "endpoint": "/embeddings",
 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note records the decision that the catalog will keep image metadata in a separate table, and when was it written?\n[2025-04-01] standup/cinder/2025-04-01: We agreed today that the catalog will keep image metadata in a separate table. The reason is that the joined writes were locking product updates for seconds at a time. [2025-11-07] standup/boreal/2025-11-07: We agreed today that search-indexer will rebuild the index nightly instead of on every catalog write. The reason is that incremental updates left stale entries behind after failed writes. [2025-09-15] standup/cinder/2025-09-15: Reminder that the catalog service depends on image-resizer.",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
